OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects are all British
OL,4,Amen in their 20s, counter-terror police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter Terrorism Policing Senior
OL,8,FNational Coordinator Vicki Evans says
OL,9,Fshe is "very aware of the levels of
OL,10,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,11,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,12,Fquestions that are being raised"
OL,14,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,15,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,16,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,17,Fplans - here's the WhatsApp she sent
OL,18,Fher neighbours at 01:49 on Sunday
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
